# Frink: Frink documentation (frinklang.org); requirements/languages/frink.md
name     frink frk
keyword  if then else while for to step do return class var new and or not println print input
builtin  true false undef meter second kilogram mile hour
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes interp=dollar
operators  +-*/^=<>:|!.->[]
calls
